<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>part of the main premise is that this, compared to most SCP’s, would be considered “safe”, and in that thinking there are oversights in how they handle it. Not so much an ethical dilemma as much as a failing on there part for just kind of not caring about the researchers there.</p>
