<p>The reason they are so isolated is due to the difficulty of the reaching the SCP’s Getting there would require mounting an expedition in a submersible every time, thus the teams work in monthly shifts, similar to the ISS. If it helps, a slight amendment to the corpse issue: to keep from leaving a rotting corpse in their base while awaiting retrieval , they anchor it outside in the ocean, only for it to drift into the entrance</p>
