</div>
</div>
<p>Thank you for the critique, and if you could aee there any ideas you can come up with to make it more interesting to you? The base idea i def wanna keep is “a safe, deep sea, location SCP that ends up with a research crew in chaos”, so anything around that and I’m flexible. thank you!</p>

